{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/77490-ready-made-demons","id":77490,"title":"Ready-made demons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-22T23:09:48-08:00","id":77490,"title":"Ready-made demons","content":"Yesterday I run Demon's quickstarter on local convention and it was blast - I've got like 7-8 people interested. But with &quot;<b>Honey &amp; Vinegar</b>&quot; adventure are only 4 ready charactes, so we needed to make new character - and it was llloooonnnggg. Like in whole nWoD, but with all powers, Covers persona, Demonic Form - it was rather complicated. So I'm asking could there be made more ready characters, or you just share with your favorites PCs from game sessions? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-23-2014, 02:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T23:22:05-08:00","id":77494,"title":"","content":"I believe there's going to be a book of ready-made NPCs coming, as a part of the kickstarter.<br /> <br /> That said, this thread could serve as a place to share some PCs and NPC demons. I might contribute here as well!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T01:21:53-08:00","id":77523,"title":"","content":"There should be five ready-made characters coming out soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T06:44:20-08:00","id":77629,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the last thing I saw on the Monday Meeting notes was that the Demon Ready-Made Player characters were either waiting on the art, or getting the art together. Something like that. Anyway, it's in the art phase.<br /> <br /> Oh, and there's four, not five. There are only four Incarnations, after all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T09:01:36-08:00","id":77668,"title":"","content":"When is the PDF coming out on drivethru for all of us non kick starter backers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2070-daway","name":"DaWay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T09:17:39-08:00","id":77675,"title":"","content":"I have no idea. I just wrote 'em. The rest of it is in other, far more capable hands. Sorry I can't give you a better answer, but I don't have one, I'm afraid. Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T11:44:12-08:00","id":78472,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm not sure, either. The text is edited and over in production for layout and art; hopefully soon. I'm keen to see the finished product!<br /> <br /> If you want some pre-made characters, you might hunt around on rpg.net. There was a thread a while back where people were making characters, so snagging a few there wouldn't be hard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T00:31:46-08:00","id":83027,"title":"","content":"I have a simple random demonic form generator if you want it.<br /> <br /> It generates a Demonic form and Embeds and Exploits, all at random. Which makes for some interesting combinations, especially when working out how a certain Embed can act as a prerequisite for a certain Exploit! (Also, the Exploits and Embeds are weighted towards providing canonical prerequisite chains, so not 100% random)<br /> <br /> Caveats:<br /> It will only run on windows.<br /> It outputs to a text file.<br /> It is not user-configurable yet (I eventually want to develop it for higher Primum etc).<br /> It runs off a set of ini files that you can tweak as you wish - but if you break the format establish Angels will cause weird things to happen..<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T05:33:56-08:00","id":83105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nikink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/77490-ready-made-demons?p=83027#post83027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a simple random demonic form generator if you want it.<br /> <br /> It generates a Demonic form and Embeds and Exploits, all at random. Which makes for some interesting combinations, especially when working out how a certain Embed can act as a prerequisite for a certain Exploit! (Also, the Exploits and Embeds are weighted towards providing canonical prerequisite chains, so not 100% random)<br /> <br /> Caveats:<br /> It will only run on windows.<br /> It outputs to a text file.<br /> It is not user-configurable yet (I eventually want to develop it for higher Primum etc).<br /> It runs off a set of ini files that you can tweak as you wish - but if you break the format establish Angels will cause weird things to happen..<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That sounds awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Can you provide a link for it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T00:00:14-08:00","id":83824,"title":"","content":"Um, not right now, unfortunately. But as soon as I work out Dropbox...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" t